WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Welcome to CareBridge — connecting emergency patients, hospitals, blood banks, oxygen depots, and ambulances in real time.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Step 1: Patient registration and login. Click Sign Up, select Patient or Patient Attendant, enter your details, and sign in to open your emergency dashboard.

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:19.000
Step 2: Creating an emergency case. Click New Emergency Case, enter patient details, symptoms, urgency level, and incident address to generate a unique Case ID.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:26.000
Step 3: Selecting required resources. Choose all critical resources needed — hospital beds, ICU facilities, blood units by blood group, medical oxygen, ambulance, or doctor assistance.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:33.000
Step 4: Selecting an available hospital. Compare nearby verified hospitals with live bed and ICU availability, check distance and directions, and select the best facility.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Step 5: Tracking emergency requests. Monitor real-time status updates for every requested resource, follow 7-step ambulance telemetry, and receive instant dashboard notifications.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:47.000
Step 6: Provider request acceptance. Verified hospitals, blood banks, oxygen depots, and ambulance fleets review incoming requests and accept to confirm capacity immediately.

00:00:47.000 --> 00:00:54.000
Step 7: Admin coordination and resource fulfilment. Central coordinators assign or reassign providers, advance emergency statuses through completion, and review optional patient feedback.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:58.000
CareBridge — coordinate faster when seconds count. For life-threatening emergencies requiring national public dispatch, dial 108 or 112 immediately.
